  "description": "Flight termination system design: the destruct charges that rupture propellant tanks on command, the command-destruct receiver that listens on a dedicated UHF uplink, and the dual-redundant fail-safe architecture that arms and fires only on a valid command while refusing to fire on noise or single failures. The system that ends an errant launch before it reaches a populated area.",
